# Source for scripts/requirements-kuma.txt, the hash-locked dependency set of
# setup-kuma-heartbeat.sh. That script talks to the Uptime Kuma API through this library to
# create the signing-renewal push monitor; without it the script falls back to the guided
# manual path and this file is never installed.
#
# Regenerate after a version bump (the .txt carries the hashes of every published wheel of
# each pinned version, so it works on any platform the Mac happens to run):
#     pip-compile --generate-hashes --output-file requirements-kuma.txt requirements-kuma.in
uptime-kuma-api
